{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/ka8ejn50envt0y5pmz9gmep6yrmbjdi.mp3","text":"需要我帮忙吗？好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/0blokzt2wz5vnfepgwwt57r5qyta5cz.mp3","text":"这里不准打地铺吗？那我在走廊里搭帐篷好了......也不行？为什么？在部族的时候，我都是累了直接在旁边睡的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/70/qvbfmx57a0lv3u18z1o2cgsdohzmrpd.mp3","text":"博士，为什么我和Lancet-2一起居住的申请被拒绝了？她是机器？不，我们已经是姐妹了，她是大姐，我是小妹。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/0iwopkllu00nmdem9aclzxdhqjxj3wo.mp3","text":"博士，嘉维尔那样的医生在外面很常见吗？她给我检查矿石病的时候，我觉得和她在揍我时差不多......所以我最后总是忍不住和她打起来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/arhjgq2ryuwcewivtgje6x1c1r89c7v.mp3","text":"大祭司爷爷？啊，他没有跟过来呢，不过他说过，偶尔会来罗德岛看一看我的。这么说起来，他真的知道罗德岛在哪儿吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/jt60uk8ipecf93jroa8ngfdt2inu88k.mp3","text":"以前，我的梦想是造出和移动城市一样大的机器。现在，我的梦想是，造出一台会说话的，和移动城市一样大的机器。可露希尔师父已经答应我教给我最厉害的机器知识了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/dsicnzl2elbptxof7gd3ylak66hh6qa.mp3","text":"......噢，我懂了，也就是说，博士是对很有知识的人的尊称，就和大酋长一样。那等我在这里学了很多知识后，大家也会叫我祖玛玛博士吧。唔，不会吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/l5ztbyls2iztuh2owwbgj20fir6089s.mp3","text":"博士，原本我想让你有空的时候和我一起回萨尔贡，告诉我一些事情该怎么做。不过你好像很忙的样子......所以，我可以让Lancet-2大姐和我回去吗？可露希尔师父也可以。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/0boocsqji2uq5zyxkvi7bl74xjeb5on.mp3","text":"外面的人整天都在为没有意义的事烦恼和打架，真奇怪，博士你也是，感觉你总是被这些事情搞得很难过的样子，给你，扳手，来和我一起造机器吧，看着机器越来越大越来越厉害，很快乐的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/emweabbvqq7nx8x0wzj4dnl2vgmjm1j.mp3","text":"看着博士睡觉，我也有点困了......呼啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/8y7jz4b9vlvut2k1x1iocr57n99liv0.mp3","text":"测试我都通过了，现在我可以留在这里了吧？我想学习建造Lancet-2那样会说话的机器......唔，代号？我的名字是祖玛玛，用名字不行吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/srv2ebv12iidgdcuf6ehfcghbsovypv.mp3","text":"居然有能和嘉维尔打平手的人......","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/gzbzkg2gufutz49y1zj2z62urzmbx9h.mp3","text":"升职？就是从战士变成勇士一样感觉的东西吗？......嗯，要庆祝一下呢，今晚和Lancet-2大姐一起在舰桥上烤肉好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/nnjgmwoltcrkx1j0kz74tiqgt92v7oa.mp3","text":"大祭司爷爷说过，这片大地是很广阔的。以前我不明白为什么他说这句话的语气有些悲伤，来到罗德岛后我有些明白了。广阔，不一定是好事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/kw9qcw5zjfoihu968vzfcnrxjtbdkar.mp3","text":"该狩猎了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/a0tigz4by06r4l4e4kppknnakh3qsaf.mp3","text":"猎物是什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/f7hq63qdxqpuqxnuf19mpwsk0kpsy2b.mp3","text":"博士也要一起去吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/nyunpliqbwrb0s65ih279jzqx5xcpne.mp3","text":"全部解决掉就好了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/6xqodqswjwjfaa9r0xi7yxvuboyprqa.mp3","text":"我随时都可以。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/m0m1921narxjxjjhwqa0pawks9bt390.mp3","text":"让我去吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/fouqrgykcujrwjcrj3fajihfpdbk8eq.mp3","text":"有人配合会更有效率。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/23/ihowfrb7763v02z3p1x34e3zi4e8x71.mp3","text":"守住这里？唔，不难。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/jukhprjdwvrjhcrowbjbq3afv6qmhq2.mp3","text":"你们比嘉维尔要弱。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/knpacbpusj73zs9fxoeqsedbgc2d711.mp3","text":"我的力气也不小哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/43/jo6z36u1drugir77fb5mcogd147qc2s.mp3","text":"无论什么猎物都要全力以赴。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/ivbhr8c9tae038zgkrd6kecg1t36plh.mp3","text":"咬住你们了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/b34c61jfqeoitqd1lghb66qtpt43u4y.mp3","text":"大丰收。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/6lnpuzkv3v6g8e42laycfdge5fpdjv7.mp3","text":"和嘉维尔比，还差一点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/qvuk6g16wpffugmnr6y3rvovh3fbezq.mp3","text":"我去追。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/6o6yzdc0ccytmq0mshw356v1amf4ah9.mp3","text":"没关系，我也输给嘉维尔很多次，不丢人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/o4ddten9c5w12wgqciwbsaaqns5hmy5.mp3","text":"Lancet-2大姐在哪里？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/b0alg6f883h28ghikuighk3j5yeeaot.mp3","text":"唔？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/p9yql6huojvevwip2xnm7d0kkdnjksn.mp3","text":"怎么样才能像博士一样博学呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/7nz4a36nhf26par7fssv71v9ro00dxn.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/llkv391qiqak8mtxxnjfbjha3cg172e.mp3","text":"博士，今天是什么节日？......新年？迎接新的一年到来？......不懂，我们部族没有这个节日。不过，大家好像很开心的样子，我也可以参加吗？Lancet-2大姐在哪里呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/t9xd7os2udkh3bovzif9gi6ui0l3839.mp3","text":"博士，我正好有问题想向你请教。","alt":"voice_cn/char_416_zumama/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/72ys9nuappxhxrjswpktex7odwhsn7m.mp3","text":"需要我帮忙吗？好。","alt":"voice/char_416_zumama/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/gj1xy9cnof9ih8jf4bb9s29ftgyk8dj.mp3","text":"这里不准打地铺吗？那我在走廊里搭帐篷好了......也不行？为什么？在部族的时候，我都是累了直接在旁边睡的。","alt":"voice/char_416_zumama/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/j4v1s65vqixqnv6gqd33simfuvz72w1.mp3","text":"博士，为什么我和Lancet-2一起居住的申请被拒绝了？她是机器？不，我们已经是姐妹了，她是大姐，我是小妹。","alt":"voice/char_416_zumama/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/89/9c9ts2cynzn0resua7deehmmtvy3ibc.mp3","text":"博士，嘉维尔那样的医生在外面很常见吗？她给我检查矿石病的时候，我觉得和她在揍我时差不多......所以我最后总是忍不住和她打起来。","alt":"voice/char_416_zumama/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/n8eade4rrvrd3t3fefleif1vazv2w85.mp3","text":"大祭司爷爷？啊，他